{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>They devoured</b> — the meaning concerns the bribe they gave to Assyria and Egypt, as is written about the kings." "The meaning of <b>also gray hairs</b> — their strength weakened and their wealth was lost." "<b>It cast upon him</b> — the derivative: gray hair cast upon him, for gray hair comes from what is born of man [תולדה]."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:28.895445359Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}